{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":21113,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"D. A. Pennebaker","original_name":"D. A. Pennebaker","popularity":0.6089,"profile_path":"/bLonM1nzO87XvyrPYyS6L2q9yV.jpg","known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/5dJ8t6CljwZ1NUXwW1nsmEpMf8x.jpg","id":135,"title":"Bob Dylan – Don't Look Back","original_title":"Bob Dylan – Don't Look Back","overview":"In this wildly entertaining vision of one of the twentieth century’s greatest artists, Bob Dylan is surrounded by teen fans, gets into heated philosophical jousts with journalists, and kicks back with fellow musicians Joan Baez, Donovan, and Alan Price.","poster_path":"/2kd5XfH2MhFlChq7DkjxWBLoYPF.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[99,10402],"popularity":1.9968,"release_date":"1967-05-17","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.384,"vote_count":177},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/qSiVTAtDU0kJd8KjHHpMfGusIMt.jpg","id":42632,"title":"Monterey Pop","original_title":"Monterey Pop","overview":"Featuring performances by popular artists of the 1960s, this concert film highlights the music of the 1967 California festival. Although not all musicians who performed at the Monterey Pop Festival are on film, some of the notable acts include the Mamas and the Papas, Simon & Garfunkel, Jefferson Airplane, the Who, Otis Redding, and the Jimi Hendrix Experience. Hendrix's post-performance antics -- lighting a guitar on fire, breaking it and tossing a part into the audience -- are captured.","poster_path":"/wEB3c5Y5spAHOQaFWcsfFky3SWb.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[10402,99],"popularity":1.0606,"release_date":"1968-12-26","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.3,"vote_count":96},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/xPaGpRcklIZaFuFjhIdjZeCl5om.jpg","id":26408,"title":"The War Room","original_title":"The War Room","overview":"A behind-the-scenes documentary about the Clinton for President campaign, focusing on